msgstr ""
"Automatisieren Sie wiederkehrende Prozesse mit agentischen Workflows, die an "
"Ihre internen Tools angeschlossen sind."

#: .\webapp\templates\website\products.html:35
msgid "AI Integration Engineering"
msgstr "KI-Integrations-Engineering"

#: .\webapp\templates\website\products.html:36
msgid ""
"Secure integration of AI services with your APIs, databases, and SaaS "
"platforms."
msgstr ""
"Sichere Integration von KI-Services mit Ihren APIs, Datenbanken und SaaS-"
"Plattformen."

#: .\webapp\templates\website\products.html:45
msgid "AI Search & Knowledge Base"
msgstr "KI-Suche & Wissensbasis"

#: .\webapp\templates\website\products.html:46
msgid ""
"Semantic search and retrieval systems that surface the right answers "
"instantly."
msgstr ""
"Semantische Such- und Abrufsysteme, die sofort die richtigen Antworten "
"liefern."

#: .\webapp\templates\website\products.html:55
msgid "AI Analytics & Forecasting"
msgstr "KI-Analytik & Forecasting"

#: .\webapp\templates\website\products.html:56
msgid ""
"Decision intelligence pipelines for forecasting, anomaly detection, and "
"planning."
msgstr ""
"Decision-Intelligence-Pipelines für Prognosen, Anomalieerkennung und Planung."

#: .\webapp\templates\website\products.html:65
msgid "Responsible AI Enablement"
msgstr "Responsible-AI-Enablement"

#: .\webapp\templates\website\products.html:66
msgid ""
"Governance, evaluation, and rollout support for safe, compliant AI adoption."
msgstr ""
"Governance, Evaluation und Rollout-Unterstützung für sichere, konforme KI-"
"Einführung."

